# Output of `dart run build_runner build` via openapi_generator.
# Today (Phase 0.2) the hand-written equivalent lives at ../models/ and
# ../apis/; nothing is written here yet. Once codegen is enabled this
# directory will be regenerated on every spec change.
#
# We gitignore everything because:
#   1. The hand-written sources are the source of truth today.
#   2. When codegen lands, the contents are deterministic from the spec, so
#      a hash-based drift check (see .github/workflows/ci.yml > flutter-codegen-drift)
#      is enough to guarantee CI catches stale-spec scenarios.
#
# To swap to committed codegen later, replace the contents of this file with
# `!*` to allow tracking.
*
!.gitignore
